    {
      "id": "claim_840e3f5b55074724a32a3f963383acba",
      "statement": "The openapi.yaml top-level description documents an aspirational 'GET /runs/{id}?include=output,logs' workflow step, but no include query parameter exists on the GET /runs/{id} operation in openapi/paths/runs@{id}.yaml; output retrieval is instead implemented as the separate GET /runs/{exec_id}/output endpoint, and there is no distinct 'logs' artifact (ExecutionOutput.message serves as the execution's message/log text) — this is a placeholder pending a persistent output/log storage backend.",
