      "id": "claim_9c842ff951704f1f9e6728005c01920c",
      "statement": "ListExecutions and ListAuditEntries both build filters from query parameters including a since parameter parsed by the handler's parseSince helper, which accepts either an RFC3339 timestamp or a duration shorthand (e.g. 30s, 5m, 1h, 24h, 7d), and apply page/limit pagination with overflow-checked offset computation, returning total/page/limit/has_more metadata.",
